<ArticleTitle>Lactation and postpartum weight retention: a randomized controlled trial of dietary counselling</ArticleTitle><Abstract><AbstractText>We randomized 410 lactating women to dietary counselling or standard care and measured postpartum weight retention at 12 months. Participants were followed with standardised dietary assessment and outcomes were ascertained by trained staff blinded to allocation where applicable. </AbstractText></Abstract><Language>eng</Language><PublicationTypeList><PublicationType>Journal Article</PublicationType><PublicationType>Randomized Controlled Trial</PublicationType></PublicationTypeList></Article>
